<title>FRANCE: France's Jospin to see audit July 21 at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>France's Jospin to see audit July 21 at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Lionel Jospin will be presented with the results of an audit of public finances conducted by national Court of Auditors members Jacques Bonnet and Philippe Nasse on Monday July 21 at 0700 GMT, Jospin's office said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 331 4221 5452</p>
